Subject: Technical clarifications — soda ash quantity and furnace capacity

Dear Mr. Andi,

To match the right grade and packaging to your furnaces, could you kindly share:

1. The number of float-glass furnaces and the melting capacity of each (tonnes/day);
2. Your annual raw-material mix, and the soda ash consumption per tonne of glass (kg/t);
3. The split between architectural glass, processed glass and any third-party (toll) melting;
4. Whether the 25,000 MT/year figure covers only your own furnaces or also resale to other glass plants.

This will help us propose a volume-based price structure and a monthly delivery schedule that matches your warehouse near Tanjung Priok.

Best regards,
[Your name]
